    sha256: 39edc3ed8ee9c875eb68ce4cd4148194b23dbd23bb6444883a2f2cae90a75337
  body: "# Applicable amount for JSA(IB) and Income Support\n\n## Authored interpretation\n\nThe captured
    guidance describes applicable amounts for JSA(IB) and IS through personal allowances and, where appropriate,
    additional components such as premiums, certain housing costs and transitional elements.\n\n## Scope
    and exceptions\n\nThe JSA(IB) and IS provisions are separate. A component is not automatically payable,
    and the applicable amount is not necessarily the final payment. DMG 23010 continues onto PDF page
    5; DMG 23028 gives the IS list and expressly notes nil, reduced and housing-cost-only cases. Current
    rates, transitional eligibility and children’s provisions are unresolved.\n\n## Inspected source passages\n\
    \n- [DMG 23010, PDF page 4](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e0f95b98c6c9802f7ed9c7/dmg-Ch-23.pdf#page=4)
    — DMG Vol 4 Ch 23: Normal amount payable.\n- [DMG 23028, PDF page 11](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69e0f95b98c6c9802f7ed9c7/dmg-Ch-23.pdf#page=11)
    — DMG Vol 4 Ch 23: Normal amount payable.\n\n## Evidence and review status\n\nModel-assisted interpretation
    of selected passages in the 15 September 2026 frozen source snapshot. Specialist review is required.
    Source acquisition, source revision, legal effective dates and this record’s authoring time are separate.\n\
    \nThis is an independent experimental publication, not an official DWP document, individual advice,
    an entitlement decision or an executable rule. Machine-extracted text may alter reading order, footnotes
    and characters. No PDF visual inspection, whole-chapter coverage or behavioural evaluation pass is
    claimed by this record.\n\n- `dmg-vol4-ch23`: PDF SHA-256 `174fce491e7a72ca89f2739a64ab4e2f3a0da6e33d9e48eaa5c33c7ff9a5f734`;
    extracted pages SHA-256 `387302f09bbce9873dbafcd6af6a19b06842b35392e7d7771058ed22a0bd8bd2`.\n\n- `dmg-vol5-ch25`:
    PDF SHA-256 `39edc3ed8ee9c875eb68ce4cd4148194b23dbd23bb6444883a2f2cae90a75337`; extracted pages SHA-256
    `db488637a179cc93910c4e243381b5c961d6959ce72cd1d34aff14e403517e73`.\n"
  semantic_relations:
